ghtlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"umq4JEgX4U6TIdMv-odD0Q","review_id":"4MiuUDRmYFy4tD31BBfxgQ","date":"2017-04-20T16:43:59","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9388139247894287,"text_excerpt":"Definitely a must-go-to stop when in NOLA. They have delicious frozen drinks and I suggest picking one up on the way to the market. It will be refreshing and delicious all at the same time. My personal favorite is a mix of strawberry and piña colada. If you are in the mood for a quick snack or if you need lunch or dinner or even a late night snack this is the place! They have delicious chicken and the biscuits are the best I have ever had! The food is ordered at the counter and then they give you a number to take to your table. The food was delivered to our table and it was super fresh and piping hot. They have very clean bathrooms (for customers only) and you need a code to get in. Very ..."},{"business_id":"umq4JEgX4U6TIdMv-odD0Q","review_id":"2CpP5WvjNKJHJ9_R5OgfQg","date":"2017-10-22T21:47:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9321141242980957,"text_excerpt":"One of our favorite places during our entire NOLA trip! Had our first meal here a few hours after getting off the plane. Me and my boyfriend split the two piece combo, which came with fries and a biscuit. The food came super quickly and was very fresh (we both burnt our tongues on a fry). Everything was so tasty!! The fries were battered and seasoned well, the chicken was crispy, flavorful, and somehow not too oily, and the biscuit was magically so buttery that I was questioning how it was still in one solid piece. They also had a spread of sauces that we had fun trying and mixing together. Service was very friendly too! We came back the next night for one of the slushee looking drinks an..."},{"business_id":"umq4JEgX4U6TIdMv-odD0Q","review_id":"Xf_bp0WxtDdSOpG2ZpZpuw","date":"2020-10-12T21:15:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9207805395126343,"text_excerpt":"Went here last night so awesome! Great chicken super fresh and hot. Great service. The biscuit was melt in your mouth amazing. Worth a visit."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"umq4JEgX4U6TIdMv-odD0Q","photo_id":"wW88c12asb9QthEdFfy5Tw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/wW88c12asb9QthEdFfy5Tw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.888931393623352},{"business_id":"umq4JEgX4U6TIdMv-odD0Q","photo_id":"DOTCcoEsOT-I_XtimFesww","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/DOTCcoEsOT-I_XtimFesww.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8653126358985901},{"business_id":"umq4JEgX4U6TIdMv-odD0Q","photo_id":"4EuxXqO_aRjdaPHCehD-vQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/4EuxXqO_aRjdaPHCehD-vQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.813555121421814},{"business_id":"umq4JEgX4U6TIdMv-odD0Q","photo_id":"YJQUO9osqEMbOKNctyrq8Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/YJQUO9osqEMbOKNctyrq8Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7280761003494263}]},"notebook_case":null}
